# Prisma and status enums

- Additive schema first (optional field), then backfill, then required.
- After schema edits: `npm run db:generate`. Local schema sync is `npm run db:push`. Do not invent production migrations unless asked.
- Keep `ContactStatus` in schema, `CONTACT_STATUS_VALUES`, and LinkedIn helpers in sync.
- Seed (`prisma/seed.ts`) must upsert pipeline stages, `default-template`, and `AppSettings` id `default`.
- Do not rename `email`, `apolloPersonId`, or `resendMessageId` without a data plan. Contact deletes cascade to drafts/sends/events.

```prisma
// ❌ BAD — drop unique email or apolloPersonId
// ✅ GOOD — add optional field, generate client, update readers
```
